"每批取收件箱最新的十封未分类邮件，包含已读和未读，按收件时间倒序。带有 Smail 分类标签的邮件不会重复出现。撤销会恢复上一封的分类标签。" = "Each batch contains up to ten of the newest unclassified Inbox messages, read or unread. Messages with a Smail label are excluded. Undo restores the previous message’s classification labels.";
