"Smail 直接连接 Google，没有后台服务器。邮件不上传到其他服务，不用于 AI 分析。" = "Smail connects directly to Google, with no backend server. Your mail is not uploaded to other services or used for AI analysis.";
"只创建和修改 Smail 的两个自定义标签。不删除、归档、发送邮件，不修改已读状态。Google 授权页面所列 gmail.modify 权限较宽，Smail 在程序内限定上述操作。" = "Smail only creates and updates its two custom labels. It never deletes, archives, or sends mail, or changes read status. Google’s gmail.modify permission is broader; Smail limits these operations in its own code.";
"批次与待同步操作保存在受 iOS 文件保护的本机存储中。正文保留 HTML 排版，脚本始终禁用；外部图片由你选择加载，可能让发件人知道邮件已被打开。" = "Batches and pending changes are stored locally with iOS file protection. The reader preserves HTML formatting and disables scripts. Loading optional remote images may tell the sender that you opened the email.";
